@startuml FR02_Access_Sequence
title FR-02 / UC-02.3 and UC-02.4 - Protected Access and Bank Role Assignment
autonumber
actor "Staff Member / Bank Administrator" as Staff
boundary "Client" as Client
control "Authentication Middleware" as Auth
control "Record Policy" as Policy
control "Business Controller" as Ctrl
database "Database" as DB
Staff -> Client: Request protected operation
Client -> Auth: Submit request with authentication information
Auth -> Auth: Verify session/token and account activity
alt Unauthenticated or inactive account
  Auth --> Client: Deny access
  Client --> Staff: Display access denial
else Authenticated active user
  Auth -> Policy: Authorize operation and relevant record
  Policy -> Policy: Check role permission and organization scope
  alt Role lacks permission or scope is disallowed
    Policy --> Auth: Deny access
    Auth --> Client: Access denied
    Client --> Staff: Display access denial
  else Role and organization scope permitted
    alt UC-02.4 - Bank Administrator assigning a role
      Policy -> DB: Read target user's bank_id
      DB --> Policy: Target bank_id
      Policy -> Policy: Check equal non-null bank_id values
      Policy -> Policy: Check requested role against three permitted roles
      alt Different/null bank_id or disallowed target role
        Policy --> Auth: Deny role change
        Auth --> Client: Role change denied
        Client --> Staff: Display denial; target role unchanged
      else Same bank and permitted target role
        Policy -> Ctrl: Permit role assignment
        Ctrl -> DB: Assign requested role to target user
        DB --> Ctrl: Role assigned
        Ctrl --> Client: Assignment result
        Client --> Staff: Display successful assignment
      end
    else UC-02.3 - Other protected operation
      Policy -> Ctrl: Permit operation
      Ctrl -> Ctrl: Execute permitted operation
      Ctrl --> Client: Operation result
      Client --> Staff: Display result
    end
  end
end
note over Policy
  Permitted target roles:
  bank_donor_collection
  bank_inventory
  bank_fulfillment
  Deny cross-bank changes and all other target roles.
end note
@enduml